s-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Snowlands (Aurora Shrine)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"AOE Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">AOE Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Pickaxe Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickaxe Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.71.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>Auroracrest Pickaxe</b> is a unique pickaxe and the only tool capable of mining <a href=\"/wiki/Aurore\" title=\"Aurore\">Aurore</a>. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The pickaxe is obtained through crafting by fusing a <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Borealis\" title=\"Heart of Borealis\">Heart of Borealis</a> and an <a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Pickaxe\" title=\"Icecrest Pickaxe\">Icecrest Pickaxe</a> on a special altar located within the <a href=\"/wiki/Icelands\" title=\"Icelands\">Icelands</a>, while an aurora event is occurring.\n</p><p>This Pickaxe has a unique ability due to its nature of being made from a <a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Pickaxe\" title=\"Icecrest Pickaxe\">Icecrest Pickaxe</a> it is unable to break any rocks aside from <a href=\"/wiki/Aurore\" title=\"Aurore\">Aurore</a>. \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p><i>Note: The Auroracrest Pickaxe will not transform if it is not an aurora event.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Gather the two materials needed  • The <a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Pickaxe\" title=\"Icecrest Pickaxe\">Icecrest Pickaxe</a> can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Golem_Shop\" title=\"Ice Golem Shop\">Ice Golem Shop</a> for $24,000.  • The <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Borealis\" title=\"Heart of Borealis\">Heart of Borealis</a> can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a> during a Aurora event .</li></ul>\n<p>With the materials acquired, proceed to the next step. For people who prefer a video guide, follow along with <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/C03I1t01w90\">this Youtube Video</a>.\n</p><p>(More info required for guide)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901221202\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.101 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 75/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 73/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019497/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.977      1 Template:Pickaxe\n100.00%   42.977      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3620-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901221202 and revision id 17886. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Pickaxes"],"links":[{"title":"Aurore","exists":true},{"title":"Heart of Borealis","exists":true},{"title":"Ice Golem Shop","exists":true},{"title":"Icecrest Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"Icelands","exists":true},{"title":"Snowlands","exists":true}],"images":["Auroracrest_Pickaxe.png"]}
